{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本標準依都市危險及老舊建築物加速重建條例（以下簡稱本條例）第七條\n\n規定訂定之。","id":"苗栗縣-GL000121/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"5db08a46d5d6df165d43e6a76229195465a7535acfb0d281dfac31af645e6a15","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"依本條例申請重建之案件，得放寬建蔽率，但以住宅區之基地為限，且不\n\n得超過原建蔽率。\n\n依本標準放寬建蔽率之案件，仍應符合建築法令及都市計畫法令之退縮建\n\n築規定。","id":"苗栗縣-GL000121/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"d06bcff826a616b77a35b9963463273dbf4ec378cf7641af4118a81c968b6873","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"依本條例申請重建之案件，其建築物高度，除因飛航安全管制外，不受建\n\n築法令及都市計畫法令之建築高度限制。","id":"苗栗縣-GL000121/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"fc7a4eb5302bedcc8fb00ace3b7d86bab9805f1c7f3469b26e15f107400ee80e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"本標準自發布日施行。","id":"苗栗縣-GL000121/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"0760487a7e1a3f98a433704c163a939df3ca09942ff350f224457b344857930a","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[],"category":"都市更新與危老","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"苗栗縣-GL000121","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"","name":"苗栗縣都市危險及老舊建築物加速重建建蔽率及建築物高度放寬標準","region":"苗栗縣","source":"苗栗縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://law.miaoli.gov.tw/glrsnewsout/LawContent.aspx?id=GL000121","retrieved":"2026-09-28T09:58:14+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"c353df18b2eada846556578374b346b170696a3692e96c2972b5b62074b988ff","sourceRecordId":"苗栗縣-GL000121","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T10:03:59+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"","effectiveDate":""}}